{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 **Welcome to the apocalypse**\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Drone Simulator: SMASH ZOMBIES</strong>, you command a state-of-the-art military drone, the last line of defense against an endless wave of the undead. Navigate treacherous terrains, execute precision strikes, and protect vital resources from being overrun.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Octane Aerial Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced drone warfare, delivering devastating attacks from above.\u200b\u00a0Take direct control of a heavily armed military drone and rain destruction from the skies. Blast through hordes with machine guns, bombs, mines, and missiles as you strafe the battlefield with surgical precision\u2014or glorious chaos. Every shot counts, and every kill feels earned.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/e2e362716f2194de95d14a708280c1a7.poster.avif?t=1752501661\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/e2e362716f2194de95d14a708280c1a7.webm?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/e2e362716f2194de95d14a708280c1a7.mp4?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Base Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade defenses to withstand increasingly challenging zombie assaults.\u00a0This isn\u2019t just about firepower\u2014it\u2019s about brains and bullets. Position and upgrade turrets, reinforce key structures, and manage resources under pressure. Every wave gets stronger, and every choice could be the difference between survival and annihilation.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/023b8466d916a02684cf37ddf68f6057.poster.avif?t=1752501661\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/023b8466d916a02684cf37ddf68f6057.webm?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/023b8466d916a02684cf37ddf68f6057.mp4?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Zombie Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various undead types, each with unique behaviors and threats.\u200b\u00a0From shambling biters to sprinting freaks and armored monstrosities, each undead variant requires a different approach. Adapt your strategy or get overwhelmed. Some explode. Some dodge. Some just won't die unless you throw the <i>big stuff</i> at them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/b73b31b448fee5a2137e375152a62b7e.poster.avif?t=1752501661\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/b73b31b448fee5a2137e375152a62b7e.webm?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/b73b31b448fee5a2137e375152a62b7e.mp4?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through shifting conditions that push your survival instincts to the limit. Face zombie waves under scorching sun, pitch-black nights, torrential rain, and violent storms that can blur your vision and crank up the tension. You\u2019re not just fighting the undead\u2014you\u2019re fighting the world itself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/ac1fcdda82769ab0e34dfc31e5d6bada.poster.avif?t=1752501661\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/ac1fcdda82769ab0e34dfc31e5d6bada.webm?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/ac1fcdda82769ab0e34dfc31e5d6bada.mp4?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression and Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade drone weapons, gadgets, and base structures. Every choice tailors your playstyle\u2014go full offense with explosive payloads or specialize in tactical defense. Whether you're a calculated commander or a chaotic guns-blazer, there's a path that fits your madness.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/426928e19279eae71a32cb997a06cb79.poster.avif?t=1752501661\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/426928e19279eae71a32cb997a06cb79.webm?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/426928e19279eae71a32cb997a06cb79.mp4?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spray & Pray","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/2899e354590e44b9cb7599f080a719289c1232f3.jpg"},{"name":"Meat Grinder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/7a3baf8af31aacb95831db745cd8b4966289c917.jpg"},{"name":"Death Dealer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/deb28541f7a7588cb50582b492688344f11823b4.jpg"},{"name":"Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/d31a616377f332c8994a1d5dd38f133dec824cb1.jpg"},{"name":"The Reaper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/0da8f859e46a4c2526dc34ec090a95f4b17a18fa.jpg"},{"name":"Extinction Event","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/86c771f3bf7880fbdd6e0ca8d58c307874d8b0cb.jpg"},{"name":"First Bloodbath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/bfd1003d6951bbd48df525e5d46c3e6f08bf6ce3.jpg"},{"name":"Decimator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/e68c8a8729b603ba22817fc717bf4647711cf827.jpg"},{"name":"Undead No More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/f25e09a00bf39c45b76344adb2382ce90478e3c8.jpg"},{"name":"Wavemaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664710/7de5d92433f939c2a1dc1e93cd13a11d93848177.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664710?t=1752501661","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/3d700bb20b9ff698659de7e8ea6c525c568fd8b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752501661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/4aee5ed4116360c7c25d111f7120e6b627eb567f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752501661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/4aee5ed4116360c7c25d111f7120e6b627eb567f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752501661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent depictions of stylized violence. Players operate a combat drone and engage in continuous shooting of fictional zombie enemies. Blood effects are shown as visual indicators of hits, but the depiction of death is unrealistic and not graphic in nature.\r\n\r\nThe game does not contain any sexual content, depictions of sexual assault/non-consensual sex, drug or alcohol use, or themes involving self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 **Welcome to the apocalypse**\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Drone Simulator: SMASH ZOMBIES</strong>, you command a state-of-the-art military drone, the last line of defense against an endless wave of the undead. Navigate treacherous terrains, execute precision strikes, and protect vital resources from being overrun.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Octane Aerial Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced drone warfare, delivering devastating attacks from above.\u200b\u00a0Take direct control of a heavily armed military drone and rain destruction from the skies. Blast through hordes with machine guns, bombs, mines, and missiles as you strafe the battlefield with surgical precision\u2014or glorious chaos. Every shot counts, and every kill feels earned.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/e2e362716f2194de95d14a708280c1a7.poster.avif?t=1752501661\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/e2e362716f2194de95d14a708280c1a7.webm?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/e2e362716f2194de95d14a708280c1a7.mp4?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Base Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade defenses to withstand increasingly challenging zombie assaults.\u00a0This isn\u2019t just about firepower\u2014it\u2019s about brains and bullets. Position and upgrade turrets, reinforce key structures, and manage resources under pressure. Every wave gets stronger, and every choice could be the difference between survival and annihilation.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/023b8466d916a02684cf37ddf68f6057.poster.avif?t=1752501661\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/023b8466d916a02684cf37ddf68f6057.webm?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/023b8466d916a02684cf37ddf68f6057.mp4?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Zombie Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various undead types, each with unique behaviors and threats.\u200b\u00a0From shambling biters to sprinting freaks and armored monstrosities, each undead variant requires a different approach. Adapt your strategy or get overwhelmed. Some explode. Some dodge. Some just won't die unless you throw the <i>big stuff</i> at them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/b73b31b448fee5a2137e375152a62b7e.poster.avif?t=1752501661\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/b73b31b448fee5a2137e375152a62b7e.webm?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/b73b31b448fee5a2137e375152a62b7e.mp4?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through shifting conditions that push your survival instincts to the limit. Face zombie waves under scorching sun, pitch-black nights, torrential rain, and violent storms that can blur your vision and crank up the tension. You\u2019re not just fighting the undead\u2014you\u2019re fighting the world itself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/ac1fcdda82769ab0e34dfc31e5d6bada.poster.avif?t=1752501661\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/ac1fcdda82769ab0e34dfc31e5d6bada.webm?t=1752501661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664710/extras/ac1fcdda82769ab0e34df